    "Apple 标准输出不写入 OPPO 私有信息，文件可在 Apple“照片”里继续编辑。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Standard output carries no OPPO private data, so the file stays editable in Apple Photos."
