    "一帧影像，动用两台手机": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One Photo, Two Phones"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一帧影像，动用两台手机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一次摄影风格转换生成 Apple 编辑副本，在 iPhone 上编辑后回传，由 Rust 恢复原机水印与 OPPO 元数据。普通批量转换队列不参与此流程。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One Photographic Styles conversion makes an Apple edit copy. Edit it on an iPhone, bring it back, and the Rust core restores the camera watermark and OPPO metadata. The regular batch queue is not involved."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次摄影风格转换生成 Apple 编辑副本，在 iPhone 上编辑后回传，由 Rust 恢复原机水印与 OPPO 元数据。普通批量转换队列不参与此流程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不保留": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
