    "摄影风格 3 已包含摄影风格 2：色调、颜色、强度之外，还可在 Apple“照片”中调整质感（如柔肤、光晕、胶片）和颗粒，需要 iOS 27 或更高版本。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photographic Styles 3 includes Styles 2: besides tone, color and intensity, texture (Soft Skin, Glow, Film and more) and grain become adjustable in Apple Photos. Requires iOS 27 or later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "摄影风格 3 已包含摄影风格 2：色调、颜色、强度之外，还可在 Apple“照片”中调整质感（如柔肤、光晕、胶片）和颗粒，需要 iOS 27 或更高版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "摄影风格 3 已包含摄影风格 2；如需单独调整，请先关闭摄影风格 3。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photographic Styles 3 includes Styles 2. Turn Styles 3 off to change this on its own."
